# .worktreeinclude — files worktree-provision.sh copies from the main
# checkout into a freshly created sibling worktree.
#
# Format:
#   - One repo-relative path per line.
#   - Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored.
#   - Directories are copied recursively (cp -a), symlinks are preserved.
#   - A missing source path is a warning, not a failure.
#   - Never list anything duplicating a secret outside .env*; the copy step
#     always chmod 0600 every copied .env* file.
.env
.env.local
.mcp.json
.claude/skills/agent-browser
